<div class="faq-content">

  <!-- GENERAL -->
  <div class="faq-category">

    <h2 class="faq-category__title">GENERAL</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Is 2INTO9 for me?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>If underwear rides up, rubs against your skin, gets sweaty, or you constantly have to adjust it, 2INTO9 is for you. It is designed to keep you comfortable and supported all day.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I find the right size?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Refer to the <a href="/pages/sizing">size guide</a> and compare it to your measurements. If you fall between two sizes, we recommend choosing the larger size.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What is 2INTO9 Underwear made from?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Our core underwear range is made from 93% Bamboo viscose and 7% spandex. The fabric brings softness, breathability, stretch, and comfort in everyday movement.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What’s different about each type of 2INTO9?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Solid and Printed trunks are for everyday use. Junior Trunks are made for kids. D-LOCK is made specially for cricketers and gives you extra support with its protective box.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I wash my Underwear?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Wash in cold water with similar colours on a gentle cycle. Avoid bleach and fabric softener. Tumble dry on low or air dry. For D-LOCK, remove the protective box before washing.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- RETURNS & EXCHANGES -->
  <div class="faq-category">

    <h2 class="faq-category__title">RETURNS &amp; EXCHANGES</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What is your return policy?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Due to hygiene reasons, we do not accept returns, exchanges, or refunds. Report damaged, defective, or incorrect products within 3-6 hours of delivery, with video or photo evidence.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Do you have a warranty on your products?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>2INTO9 does not offer a separate warranty. However, if you receive a faulty, damaged, or incorrect product, please inform us within the required timeframe (3-6 hours of delivery with video or photo evidence). We will review it and help you resolve the issue.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What is the process for exchanges?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>We do not offer exchanges for size, colour, print, or change of mind.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- SHIPPING -->
  <div class="faq-category">

    <h2 class="faq-category__title">SHIPPING</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Do you ship internationally?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Not yet. Currently, 2INTO9 delivers only in India. We plan to launch globally soon.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What shipping services do you use?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>We work with trusted courier partners depending on your delivery location.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How can I get free shipping?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>2INTO9 currently offers free shipping with no minimum order value. The applicable shipping benefit will automatically reflect during checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I track my order?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>After we ship your order, we will send the tracking information to your registered contact number or email. You can use those details to check your order status.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- ORDERING -->
  <div class="faq-category">

    <h2 class="faq-category__title">ORDERING</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I enter a discount code?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Enter your valid discount code in the promo or discount field during checkout. If it is valid for the order, it will be applied automatically to your order total.</p>
        </div>
      </details>


      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Can I use multiple discount codes?</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Usually, you can use only one at a time.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>